graph LR
    SRC[source.c<br/>Your C Code] --> PRE[Preprocessor<br/>Handles #include, #define]
    PRE --> COMP[Compiler<br/>Translates C to Assembly]
    COMP --> ASM[source.s<br/>Assembly Code]
    ASM --> ASMB[Assembler<br/>Converts to Machine Code]
    ASMB --> OBJ[source.o<br/>Object File]
    OBJ --> LINK[Linker<br/>Combines Object Files]
    LIB[Libraries<br/>libc, etc.] --> LINK
    LINK --> EXE[program.exe / a.out<br/>Executable File]
    EXE --> RUN[Run!<br/>$ ./program]

    style SRC fill:#e6ffe6,stroke:#00cc00
    style EXE fill:#e6f3ff,stroke:#0066cc,stroke-width:2px
    style RUN fill:#ffffe6,stroke:#cccc00,stroke-width:2px
